# Whole-cohort living-review reruns keep their complete local audit archive, but
# Git excludes byte-repeated Docling documents, graph payloads, contact sheets,
# staged site copies, and failed payload-heavy attempts. Versioned manifests
# hash every excluded file; compact logs, final outputs, and snapshots remain
# eligible for commit.
data/living_catalog/**/baseline_vlm_profiles/
data/living_catalog/**/combined_vlm_profiles/
data/living_catalog/**/taxonomy/runs/**/records/
data/living_catalog/**/crops*/contact_sheets/
data/living_catalog/**/atlas/
